{"caption":"","data":"putnam_1995_a3 (relation : (Fin 9 → ℤ) → (Fin 9 → ℤ) → Prop) (digits_to_num : (Fin 9 → ℤ) → ℤ)\n  (hdigits_to_num : digits_to_num = fun dig => ∑ i, dig i * 10 ^ ↑i)\n  (hrelation :\n    ∀ (d e : Fin 9 → ℤ),\n      relation d e ↔\n        (∀ (i : Fin 9), d i < 10 ∧ d i ≥ 0 ∧ e i < 10 ∧ e i ≥ 0) ∧\n          ∀ (i : Fin 9), 7 ∣ digits_to_num fun j => if j = i then e j else d j)\n  (d e f : Fin 9 → ℤ) : relation d e ∧ relation e f → ∀ (i : Fin 9), 7 ∣ d i - f i","endPos":{"column":6,"line":454},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/baseline/P15/lean/004_baseline_metrics/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":454},"severity":"information"}
